# Opalescence makes Glorious Anthem a creature with base power and toughness 3/3, its mana value (layer 4 and 7b), and the
# Anthem's "Creatures you control get +1/+1" now reaches itself (CR 613.4c, layer 7c): a 4/4 on turn 3, its Llanowar Elves
# 2/2. Humility enters on turn 5, after Opalescence: layer 4, Opalescence makes Humility and the Anthem creatures; layer 6,
# Humility takes all their abilities, the Anthem's among them; layer 7b, in timestamp order, Opalescence makes them 4/4 and
# 3/3 and then Humility makes them 1/1 (CR 613.6, 613.7; the Humility-Opalescence ruling). The Anthem pumps nothing any
# more: it is 1/1, not 2/2, and the Elves 1/1. Opalescence is no creature (it is not "other" to itself).

